Contributing
------------

Contributions are welcome. FreeSDN currently has no external contributors, so
this file lists PyPV alone; that is a statement of fact about the project's
history, not a closed door. See CONTRIBUTING.md before opening a pull request,
and note in particular how changes reach this repository: it is published from a
private monorepo by a one-way flatten, so a pull request merged here directly
would be reverted by the next release.

Contributors who land changes will be credited here.


Third-party components
----------------------

FreeSDN bundles third-party dependencies under their own licenses. See
backend/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md and frontend/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the
full attribution of every bundled package.

Vendor names, product names, logos and brands referenced in this project are the
property of their respective owners. FreeSDN is an independent project and is not
affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by any vendor it integrates with. See
TRADEMARKS.md.
